The Rust code of this crate is ported from OpenBSD's mtw(4) driver
(sys/dev/usb/if_mtw.c rev 1.13, if_mtwvar.h rev 1.1, sys/dev/ic/mtwreg.h
rev 1.2) and its rate adaptation (sys/net80211/ieee80211_amrr.c rev 1.12,
ieee80211_amrr.h rev 1.4). It keeps the notices of those files,
reproduced below.

